{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121748","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121748/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121748/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121748/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121748","id":4974278971,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc72PFRe","number":121748,"title":"Wake bodies on constraint addition and removal","user":{"login":"Schnorg","id":44937651,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0OTM3NjUx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44937651?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg","html_url":"https://github.com/Schnorg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":370471880,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNzA0NzE4ODA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:physics","name":"topic:physics","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2026-07-25T05:03:57Z","updated_at":"2026-10-16T09:04:42Z","closed_at":"2026-10-16T06:42:57Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":true,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121748","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121748","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121748.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121748.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Also allow at least one frame before sleeping, to allow bodies to integrate forces before the movement test.\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes #64890\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nBodies were not waking when constraints were removed. So a rigid body sitting on a character body would not fall when the character body was moved or removed. \r\n\r\nAdditionally, depending on when bodies were awoken, they may not have been given a full force integration cycle before being put back to sleep again. \r\n\r\nThis PR calls wake when constraints are added or removed and also tries to ensure that one frame is offered before sleeping again (which is necessary to make this PR work).\r\n\r\nThere are more robust ways to ensure at least one frame gap between sleep activations, but they require more changes and access to objects that godot_body_2d.cpp doesn't currently have access to. \r\n\r\n## Testing\r\nTested on my own game and prototype as well as the MRP from #64890 \r\n\r\nAdditionally, edit the #64890 MRP so that the CharacterBody2D moves rather than being removed.","closed_by":{"login":"Schnorg","id":44937651,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0OTM3NjUx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44937651?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg","html_url":"https://github.com/Schnorg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121748/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121748/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}